    <innernamespace refid="namespaceterminal">terminal</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>OSC protocol-extension handlers — hyperlink, shell integration, iTerm2 image. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This translation unit implements three complex OSC handlers that share the characteristic of tracking multi-event state or writing to the grid:</para>
<para><table rows="4" cols="3"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>Command  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Protocol  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Handler  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>OSC 8  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Hyperlink (RFC-draft)  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>handleOsc8()</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>OSC 133  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Shell integration  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>handleOsc133()</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>OSC 1337  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>iTerm2 inline image  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>handleOsc1337()</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
<para>Basic metadata handlers (title, cwd, clipboard, notification, cursor color) and <computeroutput>oscDispatch()</computeroutput> live in <computeroutput><ref refid="_video_o_s_c_8cpp" kindref="compound">VideoOSC.cpp</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Thread model</title><para>All functions in this file run exclusively on the <bold>READER THREAD</bold>.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_video_8h" kindref="compound">Video.h</ref> — class declaration and full API documentation </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_video_o_s_c_8cpp" kindref="compound">VideoOSC.cpp</ref> — basic OSC handlers and dispatch </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>ITerm2Decoder — iTerm2 image decoder </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
